 "structural_change": "HBM-HC7-BANK 10-20 successor of hbm_hcq_bank_b0_rc3 (its --cts gate FAILED at CTS: glue root clk pin-flop spread 674.3 ps TT, 4,418 boundary of 7,241 sinks incl. the 2 x 2,049 exit relay; one root per face spanned the whole tile around 12 SRAMs).  Glue clock partition from the cb_rc3 placement: 2 half-tile regional roots (clk_r: CPI sums + SRAM capture + lane enables of the row; clk_q: CPO sums of the row), clk in-face landing / write port / CPI scalars, clk_c stage control, clk_o CPO scalars, clk_s0 / clk_s1 exit relay stage per face; landing / control scalar pin flops anchored at their faces (OT_OFLOP_PORT_RE), 2,048-bit chain flops unanchored (anchored they would make ~605 / ~562 um single-cycle hops to the far leaves).  RTL ot_hbm_hc_bankrc_static.sv: same function, 0 added edges (ring lockstep 5.050 PASS + MUT 1/5 FAIL witnesses); geometry / pins / FAN32 as the rc3 kit.  Die pin plan / HCRING joint ranges unchanged.",
